<!-- 3.2 CART & PINCODE -->
<h2>3.2 User-Isolated Shopping Cart &amp; Pincode Prompt (<code>/</code> &bull; <code>app/page.tsx</code>)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>User-Isolated Cart:</strong> Shopping cart persisted in <code>localStorage</code> scoped to the logged-in user's UID (or guest cart if unauthenticated).</li>
  <li><strong>Shipping Pincode Prompt Modal:</strong> Before processing orders, users are prompted to enter their postal code. This ensures delivery coordinates are captured and saved directly to the database.</li>
</ul>

