<!-- 3.4 ADMIN DASHBOARD -->
<h2>3.4 Warehouse Command Center / Admin Dashboard (<code>/admin</code> &bull; <code>app/admin/page.tsx</code>)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Target User:</strong> Warehouse operations staff, inventory managers, system administrators.</li>
  <li><strong>Page Title:</strong> <code>Warehouse Command Center | FlashCart Admin</code></li>
  <li><strong>Security:</strong> Protected by server-side verification endpoint <code>/api/admin/verify</code>. Non-admin users are automatically redirected to <code>/admin/login</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Key Features:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Interactive Metric Card 1 (Active Catalog):</strong> Displays total registered products. Clicking navigates to the full inventory database.</li>
      <li><strong>Interactive Metric Card 2 (Low Stock Alert):</strong> Displays count of critical inventory items (&lt;10 units). Clicking navigates to filtered table view (<code>?filter=low</code>).</li>
      <li><strong>Interactive Metric Card 3 (Expiry Alerts):</strong> Displays count of expired items and items expiring in the current 7-day window. Clicking navigates to <code>?filter=expiring</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>Quick Action Launcher:</strong> Prominent shortcut buttons for <em>+ Add New Product</em> and <em>+ Add Admin Wizard</em>.</li>
      <li><strong>User Profile Dropdown:</strong> Modern avatar circle showing administrator initials, email address, and a one-click Sign Out action.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

