<!-- 3.5 INVENTORY DATABASE TABLE -->
<h2>3.5 Inventory Database Table with Inline Editors (<code>/admin/products</code> &bull; <code>app/admin/products/page.tsx</code>)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Target User:</strong> Inventory controllers and warehouse dispatchers.</li>
  <li><strong>Page Title:</strong> Dynamic based on active filter (<code>Inventory Database</code> / <code>Low Stock Alerts</code> / <code>Expiry Alerts</code>).</li>
  <li><strong>Key Features:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Inline Stock Editor:</strong> Allows updating stock quantities on the fly using <code>[-]</code> and <code>[+]</code> step buttons or by clicking the badge to enter any numeric quantity. Updates are dispatched via <code>/api/admin/update-stock</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>Inline Expiry Date Editor:</strong> Administrators can modify the expiration date directly in the table using a native HTML5 date picker, persisting changes via <code>/api/admin/update-expiry</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>Visual Expiry Badges:</strong>
        <span class="badge badge-red">&#9888; EXPIRED</span> for items past current date;
        <span class="badge badge-amber">&#9203; Expiring Soon</span> for items expiring within 7 days;
        <span class="badge badge-green">&#10003; Valid</span> for safe items.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Product Deletion:</strong> Trash icon with double-confirmation dialog triggers cascade deletion via <code>/api/admin/products/delete</code>.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

